      "head": "Why does a car need *gears*?",
      "pose": "think",
      "face": "think",
      "prop": {
       "type": "gears",
       "r1": 70,
       "r2": 140
      }
     },
     "Why can a bicycle have one gear, but a car needs five or six?"
    ],
    [
     "c03_2",
     {
      "label": "the problem",
      "head": "Engines like a *narrow* speed range",
      "pose": "shrug",
      "face": "smug",
      "prop": {
       "type": "chart",
       "title": "ENGINE POWER",
       "xl": [
        "IDLE",
        "REDLINE"
